    <string name="remote_warn_text">• Anyone who learns the address can reach the login page; a remote password is required and two-step verification is recommended.\n• Speed depends on your home or mobile upload speed; it uses mobile data and battery.\n• Cloudflare\'s free plan isn\'t meant for heavy video streaming; for personal use it\'s usually fine, but there\'s no guarantee.\n• TVs/DLNA and management are never reachable remotely; camera, phone status, apps and uploads need separate permission below.</string>
